  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2017/09/FestaIniciCursCasalJoveOnda.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>(15 fotos) La nit d&#39;aquest divendres s&#39;ha fet la festa d&#39;inici de curs del Casal Jove d&#39;Onda, que des d&#39;aquest estiu torna a estar gestionat per l&#39;empresa M&oacute;n d&#39;animaci&oacute;.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/festainicicurscasaljove/img_6440.jpg\" alt=\"img_6440\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/festainicicurscasaljove/img_6441.jpg\" alt=\"img_6441\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/festainicicurscasaljove/img_6446.jpg\" alt=\"img_6446\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/festainicicurscasaljove/img_6452.jpg\" alt=\"img_6452\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/festainicicurscasaljove/img_6468.jpg\" alt=\"img_6468\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/festainicicurscasaljove/img_6469.jpg\" alt=\"img_6469\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/festainicicurscasaljove/img_6471.jpg\" alt=\"img_6471\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/festainicicurscasaljove/img_6472.jpg\" alt=\"img_6472\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/festainicicurscasaljove/img_6475.jpg\" alt=\"img_6475\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/festainicicurscasal